<VI _name="AI_Data_Tdms.vi" description="NI 9203 (8ch, 4-20 mA) current acquisition with DAQmx, per-channel scaling and TDMS save.\0AStart: creates the AI current task (0-20 mA range), sample clock timing (finite or continuous) and starts it.\0ATimeout (while running): reads N samples/ch as 2D DBL [ch][sample] in A, scales each channel EU = min + (I[mA]-4)/16*(max-min) using row ch of Scale (Min/Max) [min,max], charts it and appends it to the buffer. Finite mode stops the task after one read.\0AStop: stops and clears the task.\0ASave Data: opens a file dialog (name and folder) and writes the buffered scaled data of every channel to TDMS (group AI Data, channels CH0..CHn).\0AClosing the panel ends the VI. Runs only when error in carries no error.">
